<<
/Title (K-Means clustering and PCA were successfully implemented on the Wine dataset. The best number of clusters was k = 3 \(silhouette 0.2849\), and the clusters matched the wine classes well \(adjusted Rand index 0.8975\). PCA showed that 10 of the 13 components retain 95% of the variance, and the first two components retain 55.4%. Clustering the 2-component data gave nearly the same adjusted Rand index \(0.8951\) with a much higher silhouette score \(0.5611\), so dimensionality reduction kept the cluster structure while making the data easy to visualise.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 19 0 R
>>
